  "description": "All the performance you expect from Goat Power Bikes, now in a more compact form. Built for riders who want a lower seat height without sacrificing capability.With a 29.5-inch seat height, the Mini Goat is designed to comfortably fit riders with a 24–34-inch inseam, or approximately 5'0\" to 6'3\". Its compact footprint delivers the same confident riding experience in a more accessible package.Seat Extension Available: The Motor Goat Seat Extension is compatible with the Mini Goat for riders who prefer a higher seating position.Seat Decal Colors: The All-Black model comes with the grey seat logo, and the Gold Forks model comes with the Original Gradient orange seat logo.Vehicle Classification & Legal Information: This product may not qualify as an electric bicycle (\"e-bike\") under the laws of every jurisdiction. Vehicle classifications, licensing, registration, insurance requirements, and permitted operating locations vary by location.Factory Configuration: The Mini Goat ships from the factory configured with a 20 MPH speed limit. Additional operating modes may be available as described in the owner's manual. Owners and operators are responsible for complying with all applicable federal, state, and local laws.Learn more by visiting our Vehicle Classification & Legal Information page.",
